{"title":"2023 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A new mathematical operation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/0/4009b8856bc3d7845a75339345e1418a0c80c952.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacklozenge$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"14\" height=\"16\" />, is defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/0/ae0e1c4a98a3719c4963674e9e21986aa2903a16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\blacklozenge b = \\frac{2a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />.<br />\nFor example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/e/6fec84b4e8560c81d2e220608f83cd687e09c84e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\blacklozenge 3 = \\frac{2 \\times 6}{3} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"134\" height=\"38\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/0/650af6d9c88ce5e2323cdf2639ec02cb26180f73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\blacklozenge 4 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/e/00e9894c3cefd11cfbaf5dc5f5102b009b978a99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\blacklozenge 4 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/5/d653ae1eed0fb09de6f72ee3b4b83ca07d96d013.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2a}{4} = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"67\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/0314bf0fe4ca450db83b6d77e4627533e0bb8880.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{2} = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"58\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/3/483409612e6e6af44d8fb274204fec81b7da382d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 18 \\times 2 = \\boxed{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"139\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC\" title=\"2023 CIMC\">2023 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2023 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" 